) Correction: Commercial Serological Antibody Detection Tests for the Diagnosis of Pulmonary Tuberculosis: A Systematic Review. PLoS Med 4(8): e254. doi: <ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040254">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040254</ext-link></meta-value></custom-meta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>Correction for:</p><p>Steingart KR, Henry M, Laal S, Hopewell PC, Ramsay A, et al. (2007) Commercial Serological Antibody Detection Tests for the Diagnosis of Pulmonary Tuberculosis: A Systematic Review. PLoS Med 4(6): e202. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0040202">10.1371/journal.pmed.0040202</ext-link></p><p><xref ref-type="fig" rid="pmed-0040254-g001">Figure 1</xref> contained an error. Of the 515 articles selected for full-text review, in the box entitled &#x0201c;Excluded,&#x0201d; the number for &#x0201c;Relevance to topic&#x0201d; should read 34, not 340. The revised figure appears below:</p><fig id="pmed-0040254-g001" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><title>Flow Diagram for Study Selection</title></caption><graphic xlink:href="pmed.0040254.g001"/></fig></body></article>